### Security (non-negotiable)
- No secrets in the repo: environment variables, GitHub Secrets, AWS SSM / Secrets Manager, .NET user-secrets.
- Only `.env.example` files with dummy values are versioned.
- The agent does not read `.env` files, does not deploy to production itself and does not push to `main`.
- AWS only through OIDC from GitHub Actions.
